{"v":4,"catch":"你掌控著一支使用 Battle Mech 的維和部隊「DAT」。你必須拯救地球移民和火星殖民地免受崛起中的 ANTS 的威脅。","desc":"ASSAULT GUNNERS HD EDITION 讓你掌控一支名為「DAT」的維和部隊。你要和你的三台 Battle Mech 一同，試著拯救地球移民和火星殖民地免受崛起的 ANTS 的威脅。對火星及新規劃的完美人類烏托邦造成威脅的這一力量，其領導者究竟是什麼身份？\n\n擁有 35 個充滿戰鬥的全長任務，一個稱為「Inferno Mode」的部落遊戲模式，該模式涵蓋 5 個不同的地圖和超過 100 個可定制的機甲可供你和你的隊友使用。在獨立版本的 ASSAULT GUNNERS HD EDITION 中有很高的重玩性且內容十分豐富。","publisher":"Marvelous Entertainment","release":"2020-02-20","genres":["動作","射擊"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.7GB / Switch 0.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d14654ae3a0bdb7f90ef067b7d8ce9dc1f1fae0a4996a0bd316c4ce74007b832.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f19e0069ec5e092b9c585e23ba97265a0eec444563a27057af176bba2f5f9ab9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/62b0c204f1347de166868b6b4abc3a9cae9d1389bae1b6786d6b698005b857d7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9855b0bc41755f6633099d2f4876df46db1d336985c4d1befd8953b0bb809462.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4f487b392d053939ffa0446041c0f47da1e23e431ff507b45a0424ab71f9610e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/745ed7f677a7d60eac5e61b002dfe70cd573410b877e2e38ee0ba54af53648a0.jpg"],"titleId":"01009a400a97c000","dlc":[]}